      "evidenceText": "Clay Travis on X: \"I nailed all my election predictions in 2024, not so much in 2022. Here are my 2026 calls with a reminder that all of you should get out and vote. Byron Donalds wins Florida Gov comfortably. Senate: Ken Paxton wins Texas, Mike Rogers wins Michigan, Jon Husted wins Ohio, Ashley Hi… / X Post Log in Sign up Post Log in Sign up Clay Travis on X: \"I nailed all my election predictions in 2024, not so much in 2022. Here are my 2026 calls with a reminder that all of you should get out and vote. Byron Donalds wins Florida Gov comfortably. Senate: Ken Paxton wins Texas, Mike Rogers wins Michigan, Jon Husted wins Ohio, Ashley Hinson wins Iowa, Susan Collins wins Maine, the real Dan Sullivan wins Alaska, Kansas, South Carolina & Nebraska aren’t close, Republicans win senate races easily in those states. Polls are badly biased against Republicans for the 16th out of the past 17 election cycles.\" Conversation Clay Travis @ClayTravis I nailed all my election predictions in 2024, not so much in 2022. Here are my 2026 calls with a reminder that all of you should get out and vote. Byron Donalds wins Florida Gov comfortably. Senate: Ken Paxton wins Texas, Mike Rogers wins Michigan, Jon Husted wins Ohio, Ashley Hinson wins Iowa, Susan Collins wins Maine, the real Dan Sullivan wins Alaska, Kansas, South Carolina & Nebraska aren’t close, Republicans win senate races easily in those states. Polls are badly biased against Republicans for the 16th out of the past 17 election cycles. 5:20 PM · Nov 1, 2026 · 2.7M Views 2.3K 2K 12K 1.8K Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Relevant people Clay Travis @ ClayTravis Follow @sportnstate boss: sportandstate.com , @outkick founder @clayandbuck radio 12-3 pm et, dad of three boys, lawyer What’s happening Show more Clay Travis @ClayTravis I nailed all my election predictions in 2024, not so much in 2022. Here are my 2026 calls with a reminder that all of you should get out and vote. Byron Donalds wins Florida Gov comfortably. Senate: Ken Paxton wins Texas, Mike Rogers wins Michigan, Jon Husted wins Ohio, Ashley Hinson wins Iowa, Susan Collins wins Maine, the real Dan Sullivan wins Alaska, Kansas, South Carolina & Nebraska aren’t close, Republicans win senate races easily in those states. Polls are badly biased against Republicans for the 16th out of the past 17 election cycles. 5:20 PM · Nov 1, 2026 · 2.7M Views 2.3K 2K 12K 1.8K SouthEast Golfer @CFBGolfer Nov 4 GIF 4 2.7K 168K Brenden Schaeffer🎳 @bschaeffer12 Nov 4 You nailed it again 9 3 2.7K 104K colleen @waysandmeans71 Nov 1 Basically you think all the Republicans are going to win regardless. That’s silly. You owe Tim Miller a million bucks. 5 4 1.2K 70K",
