      "id": "8f69eaca928ffc84faf698cdb293bbcaa6e73ba75fe54d53cb2f94efd97a4bce",
      "title": "Briefing: The AI image gotcha game",
      "url": "https://indicator.media/p/briefing-the-ai-image-detection-editing-gotcha-game",
